{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/08/24/8053288/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近ひめたんとの写メばっかり"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/08/24/8053288/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふふふ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"肩からひめたん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さて\n福岡2日間終わりましたー！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/08/24/8053288/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、\n昨日なんだけどね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日めっちゃ早く寝ちゃったみたいで\n朝更新になりました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すみません(´･_･`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださったみなさん\nありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/08/24/8053288/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この2日間、\n世間はきっと武道館の方に意識が向いていたのに\n福岡国際センターに集まってくださったみなさん\n本当にありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/08/24/8053288/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"福岡すごい好きなので\n今年も来れて嬉しい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/08/24/8053288/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"鉄なべ餃子\nと\nミオミオの\nピリ辛ひき肉とさくさくポテトのサラダパスタ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きなのよねー\n食べたかったー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、食べ物の話に\nさっそく入っちゃったので\n福岡グルメレポいきます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ食べてないけどもらったものも含め！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"博多通りもん\nチロリアン\nざびえる\n肥後三彩\nカステラ巻き\n黒糖ドーナツ棒\nかすたどん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"福岡だけじゃなく\n九州全体だね(・∀・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもたくさんもらえたし\nもう、なんでもあり！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ただ、\nめんべいも頂いてたんだけど\n中田が戻ってきた時にはもう無くなってた..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めんべい大好きなのに(´･_･`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして\n去年も来ていただいた\nShin-Shinさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は油そば\n今日は長浜ラーメン"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"食べました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2日連続\nエネルギーを贅沢に摂取しちゃいました(・∀・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあラーメン好きなのに\nあんまり食べる機会無いから\n食べれて良かった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/08/24/8053288/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして\nHKT48の田島芽瑠さんが来てくださってました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Full Fullの明太フランスいただきました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"HKT48さんの755で前に見たことがあって\n食べてみたかったの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/08/24/8053288/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃ美味しかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/08/24/8053288/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次は大阪！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"地方ラストだね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/08/24/8053288/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"当日券もあるので\nこれまでの全国ツアーを見て\nライブもう一回見ておきたい！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"平日だけど\n急に休みになった！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんて方がいたら\n是非来て下さい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/08/24/8053288/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}